{"product_id":"your-masters-thesis-how-to-plan-draft-write-revise","title":"Your Masters Thesis: How to Plan, Draft, Write \u0026 Revise","description":"\u003cp\u003eA Master's dissertation is different from an academic essay; yet often post-graduate students are expected to make the transition without guidance. This guide brings together advice from a team of experts, drawn from the number of UK universities. Chapters cover: planning\/organizing a thesis; understanding the role of theory; constructing and interpreting qualitative data; analyzing quantitative data; writing; legal and ethical issues; the submission and examination process and publishing. The book includes one-minute summaries, case studies, discussion points and questions and answers. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Alan B. Bond \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781842850695 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 160\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44983300128921,"sku":"12RB9781842850695","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/25abc0a72270b6f8eb29c61ce3446ff7.jpg?v=1732643337","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/your-masters-thesis-how-to-plan-draft-write-revise","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}